Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0428-starbite-m8a-display.patch - StarbiteDisplay
 replaces SweetFramebuffer on STARLTE (copy of
 starbite/apple-drivers/StarbiteDisplay at 0d957fd, STARLTE-only build units,
 legacy ties on): StarbiteDisplay on the board ADT's starbite,decon nub,
 AppleCLCD on disp0 (or starbite,display); with today's ADTs (no decon node)
 AppleCLCD waits 3 s for StarbiteDisplay, then CPU copy with timer vsync, a
 rewrite of SweetFramebuffer's path (sbdisp=copy on daily lines is the
 driver's recommendation); SweetSurface.h forwarder for the driver's include

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
